        "cited_text": "2023 — Permenkumham 22/2023: E23 Index System Status: VERIFIED (0.85) Impact: KITAS for TKA now uses index E23 (replaces old C312) Source chain: kitas_e23_tka_guida_2025.txt (T2) Affected: All TKA work permits 2021 — PP 34/2021: RPTKA Replaces IMTA Status: VERIFIED (0.82) Impact: RPTKA approval now serves as work authorization. IMTA abolished as separate document. Source chain: izin_kerja_tka_procedura_completa_2025.txt (T2), nb2_tka_rptka_guide.txt (T1) DKP-TKA: USD 100/month/position, prepaid for full contract"
