        "cited_text": "OPS-007 — BPJS Non-Compliance Penalties BPJS Ketenagakerjaan non-enrollment: administrative sanctions — late enrollment fines 2% per month on unpaid contributions. OSS compliance flag: companies without BPJS enrollment cannot update OSS licenses or file LKPM. DPMPTSP cross-checks BPJS enrollment status for business license renewals. Criminal exposure under UU 24/2011 Pasal 55: up to IDR 1 billion fine OR 8 years imprisonment (for corporate director). DJP Coretax 2026 integration: tax system now cross-references BPJS payroll data with PPh 21 payroll reports — discrepancies trigger audit flags. Source: UU 24/2011 Pasal 55, PP 44/2015, PP 46/2015."
